  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now replance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>by&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; infinite times,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>On adding, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
